  "body": "Welcome to 40 Rockpool Road, a stunning brand-new architectural build located in the heart of Orewa's prestigious Pacific Heights. Boasting striking dark vertical cladding accented with warm timber tones, this home offers incredible street appeal and a sophisticated modern lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSpacious Living & Entertaining\r\nStep inside and be wowed by the incredible sense of space! The ground floor is designed for seamless open-plan living.\r\n* Light & Airy: Brilliant high ceilings and beautiful light oak-style flooring amplify the open-plan lounge and dining areas.\r\n* Entertainer's Kitchen: The heart of the home features a sleek island bench, perfect for casual family breakfasts or hosting guests while you cook.\r\n* North facing Indoor-Outdoor Flow: Wide double sliding doors open completely from the living space onto a massive 7.4m rear deck, ready for summer barbecues!\r\n\r\nVersatile 4 Bed + 2nd Living Configuration\r\nDesigned with maximum flexibility in mind, this home effortlessly adapts to your lifestyle. While currently staged and set up as a bedroom, the versatile second living space provides the freedom to use the home exactly as you need.\r\n* Dual Living Option: Keep it as a dedicated second living room, media den, or kids' lounge or easily utilize the space as an expansive extra bedroom suite or private home office.\r\n* 4 Dedicated Bedrooms: Generous accommodation throughout, ensuring ample space, comfort, and natural light for the entire family.\r\n* Downstairs Convenience: Ground-floor bedroom accommodation alongside a full bathroom, ideal for extended family, older guests, or independent living.\r\n* Elevated Views Upstairs: Head upstairs to find the remaining bedrooms, with two rooms boasting a fantastic elevated outlook, including views out to sea.\r\n* Primary Suite: The master bedroom includes a private ensuite and plenty of space to unwind at the end of the day.\r\n* Sleek Bathrooms: 3 beautifully appointed bathrooms feature modern walk-in showers (clean lines and low maintenance, with no baths to scrub!).\r\n\r\nThe Pacific Heights Lifestyle\r\nThis home comes fully loaded with a modern alarm system and a single garage with handy internal access.\r\n* Nature Meets Coast: Enjoy being surrounded by preserved native bush and walkways while remaining just minutes from the sands of Orewa Beach.\r\n* Top Schooling: Located right near the highly regarded Nukumea Primary School and Orewa College.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to secure a high-quality home in a community where nature is preserved.\r\nWith title and CCC still to be completed, you have time to prepare your finances.  If you require earlier occupancy, there is the option to move in under an occupancy agreement until settlement.\r\n\r\nCall or email the agents for more information.  See you at our open homes or call for a private viewing.",
